USE OF BARANGAY FACILITIES AND PROPERTIES 

STEPS ON HOW TO USE USE OF BARANGAY FACILITIES AND PROPERTIES: 

    1. Go to Barangay Hall and log in on the record book with the purpose to the Officer of the Day. 

    2. Officer of the Day or Custodian will prepare Barangay properties being borrowed with the number of days.

    3. Pay the total amount of rental fee to the Treasurer for the issuance of Official Receipt before the release of the Barangay properties.

COST OF RENTALS ON BARANGAY PROPERTIES:

    1.Monobloc chairs - ₱10.00(PHP)/day 

    2.Wok - ₱200.00(PHP)/day

    3.Pot - ₱200.00(PHP)/day 

